      },
      "exploitScenario": "A user calls deposit() sending 1 Ether. Later, the user attempts to call withdraw() to reclaim their funds, but the transaction reverts because tx.origin != owner. The user's Ether remains trapped in the contract indefinitely with no available withdrawal path.",
      "recommendation": "Remove the tx.origin restriction or implement a proper withdrawal mechanism allowing each user to withdraw only their own balance using msg.sender-based checks.",
